  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2024 IOM Iraq Displacement Tracking Matrix</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to support international actors, coordination mechanisms (including the Durable Solutions Task Force and the Returns Working Group), as well as national and local authorities with an evidence base that supports data-driven action with aims of addressing displacement in Iraq. This will be achieved through the implementation of IOM&apos;s Displacement Tracking Matrix (DTM) activities around 5 different axes, following timely dissemination of results to government authorities, UN Country Team (UNCT) partners, non-governmental organizations (NGOs), think tanks, media, academics, and other stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
